1. Build pinned tooling and the pure game core, including board codes, snapshots, replay and unit tests.
2. Implement the React game, board navigation, session timing and storage, reproduction controls, artwork and responsive styles in the documented architecture.
3. Add browser acceptance journeys, check accessibility and offline behavior, fix findings, record verified tool versions, and emit `dist/index.html`.
